        operations: ["list() — the lights of the stops, kept while nothing changes", "state(id) — green, amber, red or red-amber", "walk(areaId) — may people cross now?", "_walk(id)", "forArea(areaId)", "forDock(dockId) — the light for the people getting on and off at a dock", "holdsDoors(dockId) — a tram there keeps its doors shut until people may cross", "report(areaId, crossing, waiting)", "step(dt, transit, users) — each light changes when it must", "_set(st, state, now)", "_tram(sig, transit) — a tram stands there (dwelling) or comes, moving, within 50 m (coming)", "_occupied(sig, users) — a vehicle on the strip, anywhere from its rear to its front?", "_on(sig, users) — the road users (not trams) on the strip", "_exitBlocked(sig, users) — does the traffic stand at the far end of the strip?", "blockers() — road users along the stop line, across the street: what the vehicles stop at (at red and amber, and at green while the far end is blocked); one before each vehicle held on the strip, for that vehicle only"],
